{title: 245 - More About Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #245 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 245}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]More about Jesus, I would know, [D]More of His grace to [G]others show;
[G]More of His saving fullness see, [D7]More of His love who died for [G]me.
[G]More, more about Jesus, [D]More, more about [G]Jesus;
[G]More of His saving fullness see, [D7]More of His love who died for [G]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[G]More, [D]more [G]about Jesus,
[G]More, [D7]more [G]about Jesus;
[G]More of [D]His saving [G]fullness see,
[G]More of [D7]His love who [G]died for me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]More about [D]Jesus, let [G]me learn,
[G]More of [D7]His holy [G]will discern;
[G]Spirit of [D]God, my [G]teacher be,
[G]Showing the [D7]things of [G]Christ to me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]More about [D]Jesus, in [G]His word,
[G]Holding [D7]communion with [G]my Lord;
[G]Hearing His [D]voice in [G]every line,
[G]Making [D7]each faithful [G]saying mine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]More about [D]Jesus, on [G]His throne,
[G]Riches in [D7]glory all [G]His own;
[G]More of [D]His kingdom's [G]sure increase,
[G]More of [D7]His coming, [G]Prince of Peace.
{end_of_verse}
